data scm_prerequisite_witness_focus_note: String = "The accepted SCM sequence is checked against the authority rather than inferred from the focused markdown projection. P0 acceptance leaves the prerequisite spine as declared history; the operator-authored P1 node is the one active SCM slice and depends directly on P0. P2 and P3 remain absent rather than being implied by P1 activation. Carrier-path checks stay over the declared node population so accepting a node cannot erase its authority link."

